1000 亿美元背后的 11 个细节","title_en":"Anthropic要IPO了，帮大家总结了一下招股书里11个有趣的细节。","url":"https://x.com/Khazix0918/status/2114878401190506902"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/dw9465ajr0oz1vf6ricf2074f","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"dw9465ajr0oz1vf6ricf2074f","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/dw9465ajr0oz1vf6ricf2074f","published_at":"2026-10-27T00:05:00Z","ref":"A7","score":88,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","summary":"作者梳理了 Anthropic 提交的 IPO 招股书中的11个细节。","title":"Anthropic IPO 招股书11个细节解读：千亿募资、807亿美元亏损与7美元控股权","title_en":"Anthropic要IPO了，帮大家总结了一下招股书里11个有趣的细节。","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMzA5NjEyMA%3D%3D&mid=2647687831&idx=1&sn=6502cb593318d6e324e29d278fae4fcc"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/jxpzj0z4beg1r0cktwzc0tmwe","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"jxpzj0z4beg1r0cktwzc0tmwe","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/jxpzj0z4beg1r0cktwzc0tmwe","published_at":"2026-10-26T23:37:17.237000Z","ref":"A8","score":85,"selected":true,"source":"IT之家·人工智能","summary":"OpenAI 于 10 月 27 日宣布其 AI 模型在数学、计算机科学和物理学领域取得三项研究突破。数学上给出了所有维度下局部光滑猜想的证明，从而解决挂谷猜想与斯坦因限制猜想；计算机科学上给出推翻指数时间假设（ETH）的证明，暗示相关计算任务可能有更快算法；物理学上提出量子色动力学及标准模型一种统一完备化的严格存在性证明，涉及杨–米尔斯千禧年难题的一部分。","title":"OpenAI 宣布 AI 模型取得三项科学突破，涉及局部光滑猜想、指数时间假设与杨–米尔斯理论","title_en":"OpenAI 宣布斩获三项重大科学突破，涉及数学猜想、计算机算法及千禧年难题","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/018/203.htm"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cccggvocxi7vdefusohq9tmdn","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"cccggvocxi7vdefusohq9tmdn","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cccggvocxi7vdefusohq9tmdn","published_at":"2026-10-26T20:21:41Z","ref":"A9","score":71,"selected":true,"source":"X：Greg Brockman (@gdb)","summary":"Greg Brockman 表示 GPT-6.1 Terra 的电脑操作能力已跨过一个质变门槛，用起来比他不借助 AI 时更快。其引用的 OpenAI 介绍称 GPT-6.1 Terra 能理解屏幕内容、跨应用执行操作、自然书写，以更低价格提供快速且强大的 computer use，适合承担整个工作日的更多任务。","title":"Greg Brockman 称 GPT-6.1 Terra 的电脑操作速度已超过他本人","title_en":"computer use with terra has crossed a qualitative threshold where it feels faster at using a computer than what i can do unassisted","url":"https://x.com/gdb/status/2114814747254432243"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/xmpu9lo3lbzld3tqsyrcy5e2v","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"xmpu9lo3lbzld3tqsyrcy5e2v","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/xmpu9lo3lbzld3tqsyrcy5e2v","published_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:11Z","ref":"A10","score":74,"selected":true,"source":"X：Tibo (@thsottiaux)","summary":"作者宣布 GPT-6.1 Terra 回归，称这是其首个在写作、个性和细致理解请求上显著更好的模型。该模型擅长电脑操作，可理解屏幕内容并跨应用执行操作，在 API 和订阅中提供的用量是 6.1 Sol 的 2 倍，价格更低。","title":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-6.1 Terra，主打电脑操作与写作能力","title_en":"Day 22/ Terra is back!","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2114800277677092936"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/tckw64et369c0brghxzwke9qe","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"tckw64et369c0brghxzwke9qe","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/tckw64et369c0brghxzwke9qe","published_at":"2026-10-26T19:14:26Z","ref":"A11","score":63,"selected":true,"source":"Gamma Changelog","summary":"Gamma 发布 Gamma 5，宣称重建了思考、设计和编辑方式，支持输入句子、文档、PDF、图片或旧演示文稿，由智能体在几分钟内完成调研和设计，并可连接 Slack、Notion、Granola 等 20+ 工具引入上下文。","title":"Gamma 发布 Gamma 5 及 credits、导出、预览等多项更新","title_en":"What’s new in Gamma | September–October 2026","url":"https://meetgamma.canny.io/changelog/whats-new-in-gamma-septemberoctober-2026"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/yims6bdgwsy052wrmjytgak8p","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"yims6bdgwsy052wrmjytgak8p","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/yims6bdgwsy052wrmjytgak8p","published_at":"2026-10-26T18:49:39Z","ref":"A12","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"X：OpenRouter (@OpenRouter)","summary":"OpenRouter 宣布 OpenAI 的 GPT-6.1 Terra 上线。该模型在 Agents' Last Exam 上与 GPT-6 Astra 得分相当，每 token 价格约为其十分之一，平均完成任务速度比 Astra 和 GPT-6.1 Sol 快 3 倍以上。定价 $1/M input、$5/M output，上下文 1.05M，链接 https://openrouter.ai/openai/gpt-6.1-terra 。","title":"OpenAI GPT-6.1 Terra 上线 OpenRouter，定价 $1/M input、$5/M output","title_en":"GPT-6.1 Terra from @OpenAI is live on OpenRouter!","url":"https://x.com/OpenRouter/status/2114791584755839168"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/j7spe7uspojyywb1pkgxn23hi","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"j7spe7uspojyywb1pkgxn23hi","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/j7spe7uspojyywb1pkgxn23hi","published_at":"2026-10-26T18:40:26Z","ref":"A13","score":85,"selected":true,"source":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","summary":"Meta 向 SEC 申报计划通过新股发行募资 950 亿美元，用于 AI 数据中心和超级智能投入。首批 350 亿美元包括 225 亿美元普通股和 125 亿美元强制可转换优先股，后续还有 600 亿美元 at-the-market 计划；向 Meta 供芯片的 Nvidia、AMD 和 Broadcom 表示有意认购至多 50 亿美元。","title":"Meta 向 SEC 申报拟募资 950 亿美元投向 AI 数据中心与超级智能","title_en":"Meta filed the announcement with the SEC that it plans to raise $95B in new equity to fund AI data centers and its superintelligence push.","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2114789264936534183"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/fhbcnmkxg23jig75iu44ijywc","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"fhbcnmkxg23jig75iu44ijywc","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/fhbcnmkxg23jig75iu44ijywc","published_at":"2026-10-26T17:10:23Z","ref":"A14","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","summary":"The Verge 梳理 Anthropic 向 SEC 提交的 300 多页 S-1 上市文件，列出五个细节。","title":"Anthropic S-1 文件中的五个不寻常细节","title_en":"Five weird details from Anthropic’s IPO filing","url":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1018738/anthropic-ipo-s1-filing-weird-details"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/dgly2r4fwb6y80t3im8yqqvt1","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"dgly2r4fwb6y80t3im8yqqvt1","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/dgly2r4fwb6y80t3im8yqqvt1","published_at":"2026-10-26T16:33:24Z","ref":"A15","score":61,"selected":true,"source":"Epoch AI：Gradient Updates（RSS）","summary":"Epoch AI 发布 Epoch Automation Reports，把机构内部的图表设计、研究规划等真实任务按人类员工评估标准测试 AI，领先的 Claude Fable 5.1 和 GPT-6 Astra 平均得分 65%，